* parameter file for HyRes amino acid adducts and modified residues
* (e.g. fluorescent dyes attached to Cys); companion of top_adducts.inp.
* Load together with param_hyres_mix.inp and param_metabolome.inp; utils.load_ff('Adduct').
* Dye linker bonded terms fitted from the AA A488-Cys trajectory (FRET/A488/amber);
* bonds inside the rigid amide + phenyl + xanthene are K = 0 placeholders (use rigid bodies starting at the
* amide bead: A48/A59 A05, R48 A03, R59 A07); amide-phenyl terms (M03-XAR, M03-XAR-XAR) then act inside the body.
*

BOND
!
!V(bond) = Kb(b - b0)**2
!
!Kb: kcal/mole/A**2
!b0: A
!
!atom type    Kb      b0
!## A48/A59 dye linker, Boltzmann inversion (moment matched, 300 K) of the AA A488-Cys
!## trajectory (FRET/A488/amber, 26110 frames; bonddist.xvg, A04-A05/A05-A06 from cg.xtc)
P1C   M07      9.81    2.777  ! CB-A01
M07   M07    495.82    2.899  ! A01-A02 (succinimide)
C3E   M07    258.97    2.300  ! A01-A03 and A02-A03 (shared); overrides param_metabolome C3E-M07
A2V   C3E      8.78    2.959  ! A03-A04; overrides param_metabolome C3E-A2V
A2V   M03      2.78    3.628  ! A04-A05; overrides param_metabolome M03-A2V
M03   XAR    267.79    2.700  ! A05-A06; inside the rigid body (amide + phenyl + xanthene)
!## bonds inside the rigid amide + phenyl + xanthene body: placeholders, K = 0
XAR   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A48/A59/R48/R59 ring bonds
XAN   XAR      0.00    1.000
QAD   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A07-A09 carboxylate
QDK   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! amine (A48/R48) and N(+) (A59/R59) beads
MSO   QDK      0.00    1.000  ! A48/R48
MSO   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A59/R59
A2V   XAR      0.00    1.000  ! A59/R59
!## R59/R48 (dyes on RNA ends) junction terms, Boltzmann inversion (300 K) of the CG-mapped
!## rA19 HCG ensemble (FRET/rA19, 10000 models); same fitting as the A48/A59 linker
!## R48 terms refitted from the ensemble reweighted (max. entropy) to the experimental <E> = 0.55
!## (Nuesch et al., Nat Commun 2024); R59 terms from the unweighted ensemble
A2V   RP      12.22    3.577  ! R59 A01-+P
A2V   A5M      2.31    4.479  ! R59 A01-A02
A5M   M07      2.70    3.432  ! R59 A02-A03
RS1   M05      1.61    3.608  ! R48 -C1-A01
M05   P1T      8.43    2.902  ! R48 A01-A02
P1T   M03      2.95    3.444  ! R48 A02-A03; overrides param_metabolome P1T-M03

THETAS
!
!V(angle) = Ktheta(Theta - Theta0)**2
!
!Ktheta: kcal/mole/rad**2
!Theta0: degrees
!
!atom types     Ktheta    Theta0
!## A48/A59 dye linker; ReB angles (V = K (t-t0)^2/sin^2 t), K and t0 chosen so the 300 K
!## distribution reproduces the AA mean and standard deviation (angle_0-4.xvg)
P1C   M07   M07     17.23     92.1  ! CB-A01-A02     (AA  91.9 +-  7.1)
M07   C3E   A2V      4.07    128.7  ! A02-A03-A04    (AA 122.3 +- 12.3)
C3E   A2V   M03      1.27    162.2  ! A03-A04-A05    (AA 138.0 +- 19.9)
A2V   M03   XAR      3.19    129.1  ! A04-A05-A06    (AA 121.4 +- 13.6)
M03   XAR   XAR      9.97    172.2  ! A05-A06-A08    (AA 170.9 +-  2.2); inside the rigid body: near-linear, unstable at 8 fs if flexible
!## R59/R48 (dyes on RNA ends) junction terms; ReB angles moment matched (300 K) to the CG-mapped
!## rA19 HCG ensemble (FRET/rA19, 10000 models); same fitting as the A48/A59 linker
!## R48 terms refitted from the ensemble reweighted (max. entropy) to the experimental <E> = 0.55
!## (Nuesch et al., Nat Commun 2024); R59 terms from the unweighted ensemble
A2V   RP    RS1      3.85    104.5  ! R59 A01-+P-+C1   (AA 101.8 +- 13.2)
A5M   A2V   RP       0.94    150.4  ! R59 A02-A01-+P   (AA 126.4 +- 21.3)
A2V   A5M   M07      1.45    163.7  ! R59 A01-A02-A03   (AA 141.1 +- 19.1)
A5M   M07   M07      3.35    104.2  ! R59 A02-A03-A04   (AA 101.3 +- 13.9)
RP    RS1   M05      1.68    130.5  ! R48 -P--C1-A01   (AA 118.5 +- 17.4)
RS2   RS1   M05      2.50    100.6  ! R48 -C2--C1-A01   (AA  98.0 +- 15.4)
RS1   M05   P1T      2.77    110.4  ! R48 -C1-A01-A02   (AA 105.7 +- 14.8)
M05   P1T   M03      2.75    122.8  ! R48 A01-A02-A03   (AA 115.4 +- 14.6)
P1T   M03   XAR      1.55    134.3  ! R48 A02-A03-A04   (AA 120.6 +- 17.9)

PHI
!
!V(dihedral) = Kchi(1 + cos(n(chi) - delta))
!
!Kchi: kcal/mole
!n: multiplicity
!delta: degrees
!
!atom types             Kchi    n   delta
!## A48/A59 dye linker; Boltzmann inversion of dihed_0-5.xvg (300 K), 3-term Fourier fit
P1C   M07   M07   C3E     1.501   1   -35.4  ! CB-A01-A02-A03
P1C   M07   M07   C3E     1.337   2   112.8
P1C   M07   M07   C3E     1.072   3   -89.3
M07   M07   C3E   A2V     1.782   1     3.1  ! A01-A02-A03-A04
M07   M07   C3E   A2V     1.012   2     0.5
M07   M07   C3E   A2V     0.466   3  -175.2
M07   C3E   A2V   M03     0.138   1   158.1  ! A01-A03-A04-A05
M07   C3E   A2V   M03     0.055   2    33.3
M07   C3E   A2V   M03     0.109   3  -168.7
C3E   A2V   M03   XAR     0.136   1  -168.7  ! A03-A04-A05-A06
C3E   A2V   M03   XAR     0.209   2   171.6
C3E   A2V   M03   XAR     0.159   3     0.0
A2V   M03   XAR   XAR     1.813   1     0.0  ! A04-A05-A06-A08
A2V   M03   XAR   XAR     0.516   2    -1.7
A2V   M03   XAR   XAR     0.134   3    -4.1
M03   XAR   XAR   XAR    11.916   1   177.3  ! A05-A06-A08-A07; inside the rigid body (ill-defined across the ~171 deg angle)
M03   XAR   XAR   XAR     3.023   2   -10.0
M03   XAR   XAR   XAR     0.231   3   132.8
!## R59/R48 (dyes on RNA ends) junction terms; 3-term Fourier fit (300 K) to the CG-mapped
!## rA19 HCG ensemble (FRET/rA19, 10000 models); same fitting as the A48/A59 linker
!## R48 terms refitted from the ensemble reweighted (max. entropy) to the experimental <E> = 0.55
!## (Nuesch et al., Nat Commun 2024); R59 terms from the unweighted ensemble
A2V   RP    RS1   RS2     1.107  1    172.5  ! R59 A01-+P-+C1-+C2
A2V   RP    RS1   RS2     0.380  2   -109.5
A2V   RP    RS1   RS2     0.412  3    -26.7
A5M   A2V   RP    RS1     0.489  1   -162.5  ! R59 A02-A01-+P-+C1
A5M   A2V   RP    RS1     0.364  2    132.4
A5M   A2V   RP    RS1     0.180  3   -172.4
A2V   A5M   M07   M07     0.572  1    -17.8  ! R59 A01-A02-A03-A04
A2V   A5M   M07   M07     0.066  2    -88.6
A2V   A5M   M07   M07     0.070  3    -84.7
A5M   M07   M07   C3E     1.566  1    -48.5  ! R59 A02-A03-A04-A05
A5M   M07   M07   C3E     1.073  2     99.0
A5M   M07   M07   C3E     0.761  3    -20.7
RP    RS1   M05   P1T     0.908  1      5.1  ! R48 -P--C1-A01-A02
RP    RS1   M05   P1T     0.516  2     13.0
RP    RS1   M05   P1T     0.119  3    -55.9
RS1   M05   P1T   M03     1.010  1    177.8  ! R48 -C1-A01-A02-A03
RS1   M05   P1T   M03     0.471  2   -172.5
RS1   M05   P1T   M03     0.058  3    -18.5
M05   P1T   M03   XAR     0.405  1   -121.8  ! R48 A01-A02-A03-A04
M05   P1T   M03   XAR     0.643  2    -92.2
M05   P1T   M03   XAR     0.454  3     19.2
P1T   M03   XAR   XAR     0.803  1     26.8  ! R48 A02-A03-A04-A06
P1T   M03   XAR   XAR     0.169  2   -155.1
P1T   M03   XAR   XAR     0.106  3   -119.7

IMPHI
!
!V(improper) = Kpsi(psi - psi0)**2
!
!Kpsi: kcal/mole/rad**2
!psi0: degrees
!
!atom types           Kpsi                   psi0

NONBONDED  NBXMOD 5  ATOM CDIEL SWITCH VATOM VDISTANCE VSWITCH -
     CUTNB 12.0  CTOFNB 12.0  CTONNB 11.0

!
!V(Lennard-Jones) = Eps,i,j[(Rmin,i,j/ri,j)**12 - 2(Rmin,i,j/ri,j)**6]
!
!epsilon: kcal/mole, Eps,i,j = sqrt(eps,i * eps,j)
!Rmin/2: A, Rmin,i,j = Rmin/2,i + Rmin/2,j
!
!atom  ignored    epsilon      Rmin/2   ignored   eps,1-4       Rmin/2,1-4
!
!## dye beads
XAN      0.00     -0.1200      2.3444   0.00     -0.1200       2.3444 ! dye xanthene C9; LJ deepened from A4H (-0.088) to -0.150 for dye stickiness (ACTR/rA19 <E>), aromatic stacking via NBFIX
XAR      0.00     -0.1200      2.3444   0.00     -0.1200       2.3444 ! dye aromatic ring bead, LJ deepened from A4H (-0.088) to -0.150

NBFIX
!                 Emin         Rmin
!                 (kcal/mol)   (A)
!# dye xanthene centre (XAN, A488 and A594) - aromatic stacking, set like the cation-pi rows of
!# param_hyres_mix.inp: Emin = 0.148 * PMF well depth, Rmin = sum of Rmin/2.
!# Trp: experimental dye-Trp Kd (A488 59 mM, A594 33 mM; Best et al., Biophys J 2015, Table 1)
!# -> dG0 -1.7/-2.0 kcal/mol -> well depth ~ -2.5/-2.9 (bound volume 0.3-0.5 nm^3) -> Emin ~ -0.40.
!# Tyr/Phe: no data; scaled from Trp by the Arg preferences (QdR-A2W -0.70, -P1Y -0.65, -A1F -0.50).
XAN       A2W      -0.4000      4.4314
XAN       P1Y      -0.3700      4.7968
XAN       A1F      -0.2900      4.9858
!# Arg: xanthene-guanidinium stacking, between the HyRes Arg-Phe (-0.50) and Arg-Trp (-0.70) cation-pi
!# rows (xanthene >= indole in size, but its delocalised + charge weakens cation-pi); no XAN-QdK row,
!# since QdK is also the dye's own amine/N(+) bead type.
XAN       QdR      -0.6000      4.8807

END
